    "seedNote": "The mock's first visit has nothing planned, saved, asked or recorded. The app signs in as the compared account's sibling (<name>+first-visit@…), which `mock:sample-day first-visit` makes when missing and leaves with no plans at all, so the account's own data from the other configs stays and nothing is cleared. The command stops with a message if the sibling has picked up a plan, a save, a conversation or a Paperwork record. EventsSeeder lists tonight's two events for discovery.",
